{"v":[{"a":["إِنَّآ","أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ","فِي","لَيۡلَةِ","ٱلۡقَدۡرِ"],"t":"We sent it down on the Night of Decree","l":"Inna 'Anzalnahu Fi Laylati Al-Qadri","w":[["innā","Indeed, We"],["anzalnāhu","revealed it"],["fī","in"],["laylati","(the) Night"],["l-qadri","(of) Power"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","لَيۡلَةُ","ٱلۡقَدۡرِ"],"t":"But what will convey to you what the Night of Decree is","l":"Wa Ma 'Adraka Ma Laylatu Al-Qadri","w":[["wamā","And what"],["adrāka","can make you know"],["mā","what"],["laylatu","(the) Night"],["l-qadri","(of) Power (is)"]]},{"a":["لَيۡلَةُ","ٱلۡقَدۡرِ","خَيۡرٞ","مِّنۡ","أَلۡفِ","شَهۡرٖ"],"t":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months","l":"Laylatu Al-Qadri Khayrun Min 'Alfi Shahrin","w":[["laylatu","(The) Night"],["l-qadri","(of) Power"],["khayrun","(is) better"],["min","than"],["alfi","a thousand"],["shahrin","month(s)"]]},{"a":["تَنَزَّلُ","ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","وَٱلرُّوحُ","فِيهَا","بِإِذۡنِ","رَبِّهِم","مِّن","كُلِّ","أَمۡرٖ"],"t":"In it descend the angels and the Spirit, by the leave of their Lord, with every command","l":"Tanazzalu Al-Mala'ikatu Wa Ar-Ruhu Fiha Bi'idhni Rabbihim Min Kulli 'Amrin","w":[["tanazzalu","Descend"],["l-malāikatu","the Angels"],["wal-rūḥu","and the Spirit"],["fīhā","therein"],["bi-idh'ni","by (the) permission"],["rabbihim","(of) their Lord"],["min","for"],["kulli","every"],["amrin","affair"]]},{"a":["سَلَٰمٌ","هِيَ","حَتَّىٰ","مَطۡلَعِ","ٱلۡفَجۡرِ"],"t":"Peace it is; until the rise of dawn","l":"Salamun Hiya Hatta Matla`i Al-Fajri","w":[["salāmun","Peace"],["hiya","it (is)"],["ḥattā","until"],["maṭlaʿi","(the) emergence"],["l-fajri","(of) the dawn"]]}]}